# Proceedings of 1978 Conference on Computers in the Undergraduate Curricula: CCUC9 (9th, Denver, CO, June 12-14, 1978).

**Authors:** Prather, Ronald E., Ed.

## Abstract
The 48 papers in this conference report are concerned with the use of computers in undergraduate curricula in various educational settings. Articles are split into general topic headings, including Computer Augmented Video Education (CAVE), Mathematics, Simulation, Testing, Humanities, Social Science, Computer Assisted Instruction/Computer Managed Instruction, Computer Science, Business, Science, Statistics, and Computer Services. (JEG)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED178067

